<section class="cta">

<h2>Stop Assuming Grants Are For Someone Else</h2>

<p>
Many grants receive surprisingly few qualified applications because people
believe they are only for large organizations or highly connected individuals.
Whether you're building a business, learning a trade, improving your community,
launching a project, or developing a new skill, there may be grant opportunities
available to help support your goals.
</p>

